<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>AI Connect India 2026: Free Online AI Builder Session | Jaipur Engineers</title><meta name="description" content="AI Connect India 2026 brings Indian AI founders, developers, students and creators together online for an AI builder session on September 18, 2026."><meta name="keywords" content="AI Connect India 2026, online AI event India, AI developers India, AI startup community, AI networking, student AI event"><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.jaipurengineers.com/news/ai-connect-india-2026.php"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:title" content="AI Connect India 2026: Free Online AI Builder Session"><meta property="og:description" content="A free online AI builder community session for Indian developers, students, founders and creators on September 18, 2026."></head><body><main><article><p><a href="/news/">Technology News</a> · September 15, 2026 · AI Events</p><h1>AI Connect India 2026: Free Online AI Builder Session Set for September 18</h1><p>AI Connect India 2026 is bringing AI founders, developers, students, creators and technology professionals together online. The September 18 session is scheduled for 7 PM IST and includes a featured builder talk followed by live Q&amp;A and community networking.</p><h2>Why the builder community matters</h2><p>India's AI ecosystem is expanding beyond large technology companies. Online builder communities give students and developers a practical way to learn from people shipping AI products, exchange ideas and discover new project opportunities without travel.</p><h2>What developers can take away</h2><ul><li>Practical AI product-building lessons</li><li>Exposure to current AI startup ideas</li><li>Community networking with Indian builders</li><li>Questions and discussion around real-world AI development</li></ul><h2>Event status</h2><p>The session is scheduled for September 18 at 7 PM IST. Readers should verify the current online registration details with the event organizer before joining.</p><h2>Source</h2><p><a href="https://oneshopai.com/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">OneShopAI Community</a></p><p><a href="/news/">← Back to latest technology news</a></p></article></main></body></html>